!runs/roadwatch-yolov8n-20261114-004822/weights/
runs/roadwatch-yolov8n-20261114-004822/weights/*
!runs/roadwatch-yolov8n-20261114-004822/weights/best.pt

!runs/roadwatch-yolov8s-20261114-114035/
